abstract: "Open-source introductory biology textbook, Introduction to Biology: A Generative Approach — chapters with paired paper labs and an assessment-question bank, figures generated programmatically via matplotlib and Mermaid, a curated reference list and glossary, built with uv and pytest. Text: CC BY 4.0; software: Apache-2.0."
